			<div class="content" id="post-content-4092415">
									

<p>After some months of work, here is my first SCP.</p>
<p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_193-04-1-26,_Schlachtschiff_Bismarck.jpg">The image</a> is from Wikimedia Commons.</p>
<p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1580939513" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;">The Great Hippo</a></span> for all of his feedback, this article is much better than it would have been without him. And also to the YouTube channel Extra Credits, whose <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLhyKYa0YJ_5CD6J9bBp-BsbHxYTSNpYZw">series about the hunt for the Bismarck</a> provided the initial inspiration. It's worth checking out if you're interested in the real-world version of the story.</p>
<p>The majority of the real-world information in this article is sourced from the <em>Bismarck</em>'s <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_battleship_Bismarck">Wikipedia page</a></p>

